{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Holy Carrot Simulator</i> is a chill first-person farming game where the Holy Carrot\u00a0asks for your help to plant vegetables, earn money, and to summon his friends, the three Holy Veggies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your garden with simple mechanics like buying seeds, dealing with moles, tossing leaves out of the garden, and mowing the lawn regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring colorful, cartoon-style graphics, this short and relaxing game (1\u20132 hours) offers a unique twist !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and relaxing first-person planting gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage garden tasks: seed buying, mole-whacking, leaf disposal, and lawn mowing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful, cartoon-inspired visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, engaging playtime (1 to 2 hours)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humorous and chill tone with a twist</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f A controller is required for local multiplayer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808890?t=1755156096","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808890?t=1755156096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808890/459a60fc8fed070a103a3bf30c3e791040350261/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755156096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808890/459a60fc8fed070a103a3bf30c3e791040350261/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755156096","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Custom